      "questions": [
        {
          "id": "Q1",
          "text": "In a team setting, you're most likely to:",
          "options": [
            {
              "key": "a",
              "text": "Take charge and delegate"
            },
            {
              "key": "b",
              "text": "Be the reliable executor who gets things done"
            },
            {
              "key": "c",
              "text": "Bring creative/innovative ideas"
            },
            {
              "key": "d",
              "text": "Mediate and keep the group aligned"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "Q2",
          "text": "When given a complex problem, your instinct is to:",
          "options": [
            {
              "key": "a",
              "text": "Break it into smaller, structured steps"
            },
            {
              "key": "b",
              "text": "Brainstorm multiple creative solutions"
            },
            {
              "key": "c",
              "text": "Discuss it with others to get perspectives"
            },
            {
              "key": "d",
              "text": "Research extensively before acting"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "Q3",
          "text": "What drives you most in your work/studies?",
          "options": [
            {
              "key": "a",
              "text": "Mastery and expertise in a subject"
            },
            {
              "key": "b",
              "text": "Recognition and career growth"
            },
            {
              "key": "c",
              "text": "Making an impact on people/society"
            },
            {
              "key": "d",
              "text": "Financial independence and stability"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
